        <li>Explain when a <code>bool</code> fits a fact and when it does not, and right-size the data for a new pickup</li>
        <li>Build an item that grants a capability instead of changing a number — trigger collider, tag check, starting value and all</li>
        <li>Find a property in the Unity documentation rather than guessing its name</li>
        <li>Explain what <code>SceneSwitch.cs</code> does about the Animator, and what the player loses without it</li>
        <li>Commit and push</li>
    </ul>
</div>

